s of the unlisted-parts class (line 2) now that the page reads the list, back to the council before any arm | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/stage-b-controls/CENSUS.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:921:| D577 | 2026-11-16 | Under D439 (council rounds 59 to 65): the unlisted-parts probe of arm A (the topic's wording defined as its description and outcome) sent on 18 stored requests, unchanged and changed ×3 the same day, read blind with planted controls and scored by a rule fixed before the send; a diagnostic, not acceptance | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/unlisted-parts/DESIGN.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:922:| D578 | 2026-11-16 | Under D439 (council round 66): arm A's probe negative under both countings (no unlisted parts in changed written answers against 4-5 control topics, but 2 unjustified refusals); the line stops; two bounded accounts of the refusals ($0.02 ceiling) before any further design | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/unlisted-parts/RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:923:| D579 | 2026-11-16 | Under D439 (council round 67): the two refusal accounts apply line 6's decline rules to the outcome's words; the proposed outcome-only exemption refused (D397, D417); a bounded $0 audit of the decline rules and the outcome's extra parts, then a sourced rule or no candidate | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/unlisted-parts/RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:924:| D580 | 2026-11-16 | Under D439 (council rounds 68 and 69): no reviewed repair for the unlisted parts (the decisions give no general rule for the main part of a multi-part topic; an independent reader left 29 of 63 open); arm A stays stopped; next, a $0 check of the Idea planner on new-system answer shapes | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/unlisted-parts/DECLINE-AUDIT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:925:| D581 | 2026-11-16 | Under D439 (council rounds 70 to 72): the Idea planner shows a three-choice event as Yes and Still open; the