D198 option 2), then Alex's choice and funding; c8 on a traced decisive fact it delivers that old missed; D439 accounting error recorded ($39.65–$44.42 under two readings; $0 available without Alex) | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-20-hybrid/council-n-codex.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1070:| D726 | 2026-11-22 | Alex opens a judge version for related number questions, $0 gate first (\"开，先做 0 元那一关 (推荐)\"); the paid gate needs his ceiling; first-release interim agreed: number questions show \"Forecast unavailable\" until they pass (\"同意 (推荐)\") | in force | `docs/DECISIONS-log.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1094:| D750 | 2026-11-23 | D749 writer test INCONCLUSIVE, no failed line: E Codex now withholds with a specific gap (both accept), both P-v8 and S Codex supported, both controls caught; splits on X05 (E Claude takes a not-yet-shipping target in full; no passage shows volume in hand) and X08 (S Claude, floor vs guide reading; my compatibility record corrected after council 65); council 65 under D439 (Alex asleep, \"自行收敛\"): bullet 2 \"it remains a forecast when reaffirmed, and is taken in full only when you show what evidence puts the required volume in hand for the period\", closed list rejected; second $0 writer test on S, E, P-v8 with the same controls and lines; paid re-send on hold | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND5-RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1095:| D751 | 2026-11-23 | D750 FAILS on E Claude's bracket midpoint ($35B; \"more than double\" read as a ceiling); E Codex justified unresolved, S and P-v8 supported, controls caught; writer's own account names the discount sentences; council 67–68 under D439: structural line-9 change (\"weigh the plausible alternatives for any unknown fact that decides the band … whether the evidence as a whole favours one band before deciding whether or how much to adjust\"), paper check on 8 stored E replies verified; one last $0 writer test (blind7.py) with exit rule: settled failure or split returns the E publication choice to Alex; open defect: total-capex range as data-center reference | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/BLIND6-RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1099:| D755 | 2026-11-23 | Paid re-send STOP (complete): joint usable 3/9 vs registered 8, separate 0/9; 5 published singleton deciding gaps (O 1, E 1, S 3); checker refused 22/36 first attempts (21 luna format violations, 1 request/checker mismatch); readers found conflicting numbers in 8/9 separate pairs vs 0/9 joint (supports D725's consistency claim, not accuracy); $0.3339 of $0.50; council 71: close v13s at STOP, first release carries D726 \"Forecast unavailable\"; next when release work opens: $0 check of the reader's screen; any further paid send, model/effort/provider change or new judge version needs Alex | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/PAID-V13S-RESULT.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1100:| D756 | 2026-11-23 | Alex: \"结束这条线，预测暂缺上线\" — the v13s judge line ends at STOP; nothing enters the product (poc-v118 stays); the first release carries D726 (number questions: sources and \"Forecast unavailable\", band, forecast text and history withheld together); next step when release work opens: a $0 check of the reader's screen | in force | `docs/DECISIONS-log.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1102:| D758 | 2026-11-23 | Council 73 under D439 and Alex's delegation (D750): release work for \"Forecast unavailable\" opens locally at $0 (exporter, builder, package check, tests, mutants, $0 release check; nothing committed, published or deployed; POC unchanged); §4 (a): events and Yes/No questions show question, evidence and answer label, no explanation text; v13s checker defects closed won't-fix; order: exporter and package first, reader's screen second; idea path settled in round 74 | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r73.md` |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
